From: harp
Subject: [PATCH] Add live Harp /stats local-serve ratio pill to right-side tab bar

Adds a small "L:R 62:38" status pill to the top-right of the patched Warp
OSS tab bar. The pill polls Harp's `/stats` endpoint once per second
(matching `make watch` cadence) on the configured `WARP_SERVER_ROOT_URL`
and renders local:remote share as a live ratio. When `/stats` isn't
reachable (e.g. a vanilla Warp OSS launch with no Harp running) the
pill silently disappears — there is no UI when there's no Harp to talk to.

Mirrors the existing `Autoupdate::poll_for_update` recurring-poll
pattern (see `app/src/autoupdate/mod.rs`) and the existing "update
ready" pill render (see `Workspace::render_tab_overflow_menu`) for
visual consistency.

Files:
  - app/src/workspace/harp_stats.rs   (new module: poller + snapshot)
  - app/src/workspace/mod.rs          (register HarpStatsModel singleton)
  - app/src/workspace/util.rs         (add harp_stats_pill mouse state)
  - app/src/workspace/view.rs         (render pill in right-side controls)

